# 10. Security and Data Integrity

Mandatory requirements:

- Validate all calculation inputs on the backend.
- Never trust frontend-supplied prices or totals.
- Retrieve approved prices from the database.
- Validate material-service compatibility.
- Validate measurement units.
- Prevent unauthorized pricing changes.
- Enforce estimate ownership.
- Prevent cross-customer and cross-contractor access.
- Preserve historical estimate snapshots.
- Prevent duplicate or inconsistent calculations.
- Record administrative pricing changes in audit logs.
- Use decimal-safe monetary calculations and consistent rounding rules.

