# 14. Acceptance Criteria

Phase 6 is complete only when:

- Approved pricing configurations can be managed by Admin.
- Material quantities are calculated correctly.
- Material costs are calculated correctly.
- Service costs are calculated correctly.
- Other approved charges are calculated correctly.
- The calculation engine validates material-service compatibility.
- Estimates can be generated and saved.
- Estimate breakdowns are understandable.
- Estimate history is preserved.
- Revised estimates do not overwrite historical records.
- Customer and contractor access restrictions work correctly.
- Historical estimates retain their original pricing snapshots.
- Backend tests pass.
- Frontend production build passes.
- Live database persistence is verified.
- Documentation and completion review are updated.

